-- Passage wg7-argument-writing-p04
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('a403329d-ccee-58fc-b1b7-63d03a6a0a78', 'wg7-argument-writing-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Keep the Old Depot$q$, $q$(1) The brick train depot on Front Street has stood in Millbrook since 1891, but the town council plans to tear it down for a parking lot. (2) I kind of think maybe the depot should stay. (3) The depot was where the town's first farmers shipped grain to the city, so it explains how Millbrook grew. (4) A museum inside it could display old photographs, tickets, and tools that the historical society now keeps in storage boxes. (5) Students could visit on field trips and learn local history from real objects instead of only from textbooks. (6) My grandmother says the town had a great ice cream shop in the 1950s.

(7) Supporters of the parking lot argue that downtown shoppers cannot find places to park. (8) ______ (9) A lot two blocks away on Mill Road sits half empty most afternoons, according to a count taken by the historical society. (10) Better signs pointing drivers to that lot would solve the problem without destroying a landmark.

(11) The depot connects Millbrook's past to its present. (12) Once it is gone, it can never be replaced.$q$, 'draft')
