   $q$Which sentence, if added after sentence (4), best explains how that evidence supports the claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Since most repairs are this quick and simple, they do not require an expert, and trained students could handle them.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Ten minutes is about the same length as the morning break at our school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-comparison"},{"text":"The technician is a kind person who works very hard every single day.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"This proves that the technician should be replaced by students entirely.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Since most repairs are this quick and simple, they do not require an expert, and trained students could handle them.$q$, $q$The correct sentence explains why quick repairs mean students can do the work, linking sentence (4) to the claim. The choice about replacing the technician goes far beyond what the writer argues.$q$, 'draft', '7ae270f9-354d-5e65-a996-1c19e1be7c85')
