insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('065523f5-6686-5e8a-a672-53378138940a', 'wg7-argument-writing-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-argument-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Choosing the Class Trip$q$, $q$(1) Every spring, the seventh graders at Greenfield Middle School vote on a class trip, and this year the choices are a planetarium and a water park. (2) The planetarium is a good place. (3) Our science units this year cover the solar system, gravity, and the phases of the moon. (4) The planetarium's dome show would let us see these ideas instead of just reading about them. (5) Its staff also offers a free workshop where students build and launch small air-powered rockets.

(6) Many students prefer the water park because it sounds more fun. (7) Fun matters, and a class trip should be enjoyable. (8) ______ the planetarium is fun too, since last year's class rated the rocket workshop the best part of their whole year. (9) The water park also costs 45 dollars per student, while the planetarium costs only 12 dollars.

(10) For these reasons, the planetarium is the better choice.$q$, 'draft')
