   $q$Which transition best fills the blank at the beginning of sentence (8)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Even so,","is_correct":true},{"text":"For instance,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-contrast"},{"text":"Likewise,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-contrast"},{"text":"As a result,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-effect-for-contrast"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Even so,$q$, $q$Sentence (7) grants that fun matters, and sentence (8) pushes back by showing the planetarium is fun too, so "Even so" fits. "As a result" is wrong because sentence (8) is not caused by sentence (7).$q$, 'draft', '065523f5-6686-5e8a-a672-53378138940a')
